lop a lavish seven lakh sq ft shopping mall in Goa by March 2027, with a projected investment of approximately \u20b9500 crore. The mall is forecasted to earn over \u20b9150 crore in annual rent and has already secured leases for seventy to seventy-five percent of its space. This undertaking is part of DLF's strategy, which includes three retail projects underway this financial year.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/retail/dlf-to-open-500-crore-goa-mall-by-march-2027-eyes-over-150-crore-annual-rental-income/134338724?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-314436/134338724.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "retail"}]}